2h3 [:method: GET]\r\n* h2h3 [:path: /]\r\n* h2h3 [:scheme: https]\r\n* h2h3 [:authority: localhost:5443]\r\n* h2h3 [user-agent: curl/7.82.0]\r\n* h2h3 [accept: */*]\r\n* Using HTTP/3 Stream ID: 0 (easy handle 0x5558dbd3bd40)\r\n> GET / HTTP/3\r\n> Host: localhost:5443\r\n> user-agent: curl/7.82.0\r\n> accept: */*\r\n>\r\n< HTTP/3 200\r\n< server: Jetty(10.0.9-SNAPSHOT)\r\n< content-length: 8\r\n* transfer closed with 8 bytes remaining to read\r\n* Connection #0 to host localhost left intact\r\ncurl: (18) transfer closed with 8 bytes remaining to read\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nI will look at jetty side to see if it's possible to provide you a reproducible server for debugging, because the it is still on development without a stable release.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/issues/comments/1059732346/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"sunng87","id":221942,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTk0Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/221942?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunng87","html_url":"https://github.com/sunng87","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunng87/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunng87/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunng87/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunng87/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunng87/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunng87/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunng87/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunng87/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunng87/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":6189158192,"node_id":"MEE_lADOAAiu0c5EylwSzwAAAAFw5