events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-03-06T14:35:47Z","updated_at":"2022-03-06T14:35:47Z","body":"Steps to run a debugging server:\r\n\r\n- checkout the latest jetty branch: `git clone https://github.com/eclipse/jetty.project.git`\r\n- switch to the `10.0.x` branch if it's not default\r\n- install jetty locally as maven module `mvn install -DskipTests`\r\n- make sure you have **libquiche 0.11.0** installed on your system since current jetty HEAD have version check on libquiche\r\n- checkout my [clojure jetty project](https://github.com/sunng87/ring-jetty9-adapter): `git clone https://github.com/sunng87/ring-jetty9-adapter.git`\r\n- switch to http3 branch: `git checkout feature/http-3`\r\n- make sure your have [lein](https://leiningen.org/#install) installed, and run the example http/3 server via `lein with-profiles default,example-http3 run`. This will start http/3 server on localhost, port 5443. It prints debug log of jetty to stderr by default.\r\n- call the server with curl `curl --http3 -v -k https://localhost:5443/` to see the issue\r\n\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/issues/comments/1059974044/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"sunng87","id":221942,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTk0Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/221942?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunng87","html_url":"https://github.com/sunng87","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunng87/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunng87/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunng87/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunng87/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunng87/subscriptions","organizations_u