s been opened some time ago: [8523](https://github.com/curl/curl/issues/8523) but was closed without any particular solution. Following @bagder advice to create a new issue in case same problems occurs in newer versions of curl. \r\n\r\nJetty version: 12.0.7 (with Cloudflare Quiche 0.20.0). \r\n\r\n```console\r\ncurl -w \"@curl-format.txt\" --http3-only --insecure -L -4 --verbose https://localhost:9443/1mbfile -o /dev/null\r\n* Host localhost:9443 was resolved.\r\n* IPv6: ::1\r\n* IPv4: 127.0.0.1\r\n  % Total    % Received % Xferd  Average Speed   Time    Time     Time  Current\r\n                                 Dload  Upload   Total   Spent    Left  Speed\r\n  0     0    0     0    0     0      0      0 --:--:-- --:--:-- --:--:--     0*   Trying 127.0.0.1:9443...\r\n  0     0    0     0    0     0      0      0 --:--:-- --:--:-- --:--:--     0* Skipped certificate verification\r\n* Connected to localhost (127.0.0.1) port 9443\r\n* using HTTP/3\r\n* [HTTP/3] [0] OPENED stream for https://localhost:9443/1mbfile\r\n* [HTTP/3] [0] [:method: GET]\r\n* [HTTP/3] [0] [:scheme: https]\r\n* [HTTP/3] [0] [:authority: localhost:9443]\r\n* [HTTP/3] [0] [:path: /1mbfile]\r\n* [HTTP/3] [0] [user-agent: curl/8.7.2-DEV]\r\n* [HTTP/3] [0] [accept: */*]\r\n> GET /1mbfile HTTP/3\r\n> Host: localhost:9443\r\n> User-Agent: curl/8.7.2-DEV\r\n> Accept: */*\r\n> \r\n* Request completely sent off\r\n< HTTP/3 200 \r\n< server: Jetty(12.0.7)\r\n< date: Thu, 04 Apr 2024 23:23:08 GMT\r\n< content-type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\r\n< content-length: 1048576\r\n< \r\n{ [1151 bytes data]\r\n  3 1024k    3 37943    0     0   1238      0  0:14:06  0:00:30  0:13:36     0* transfer closed with 1010633 bytes remaining to read\r\n  3 1024k    3 37943    0     0   1238      0  0:14:06  0:00:30  0:13:36     0\r\n* Connection #0 to host localhost left intact\r\ncurl: (18) transfer closed with 1010633 bytes remaining to read\r\n\r\ntime_namelookup:\t0.000055\r\ntime_connect:\t\t0.413978\r\ntime_appconnect: